Release Notes

*Insites Components* `v3.4.2` — pinned at `v3/3.4.2` (TW#26744156)

The instance switcher's toast no longer claims the target is open before the browser gets there.

- `ins-header` (v6): choosing another instance shows "Switching to <instance>…" instead of "Now in <instance>." The host does the switch (CRM sends the browser through Console's sign-in), so at the moment of the click the switch has only started. New Playwright spec covers a roster set after load, the Switch event and the toast.

*Rollback*: re-pin CRM to `v3/3.4.1`.

